### =========================================================================
### 🎓 EMAIL VERIFICATION — "sa iyo ba talaga ang email na ito?"
### 📅 Day 60 · Phase 12 (Email) · Desisyon: D-026 (soft)
### =========================================================================
### Pagka-register: email na may link  <CLIENT_URL>/verify-email#token=...   (24 oras, isang beses lang)
### POST /api/auth/verify-email { token }        → 204 (hindi kailangang naka-login)
### POST /api/auth/resend-verification            → 202 (naka-login) · ang lumang link ay mawawalan ng bisa
### GET  /api/auth/me                             → { user: { ..., emailVerified: true/false } }
###
### "SOFT": makakapag-login pa rin ang hindi pa verified — may paalala lang sa frontend (Day 61).
### 🎨 Sa browser (Day 61): Profile → "⚠️ Hindi pa verified…" + "Ipadala ulit ang link" (= resend-verification)
###    → buksan ang link mula sa terminal → pindutin ang "Kumpirmahin ang email" (hindi kusa — tingnan ang diagram 07)
###
### Sa dev: WALANG totoong email — ang email ay nasa terminal ng `npm run dev`:
###   📧 Email … "Confirm your auth-learning email address" … /verify-email#token=XXXX ← kopyahin
###
### Code: backend/src/services/auth/verification.service.ts (verifyEmail, checkResendVerification, Day 76) · controllers/auth.controller.ts · lib/verificationTokens.ts · lib/email.ts
### Test: backend/src/routes/verify-email.test.ts · Diagram: docs/diagrams/19-verify-email.md
### =========================================================================

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Register. Ang inaasahan: 201 — at sa terminal: 📧 "Confirm your auth-learning email address" … #token=
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "verify-demo@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Login (makakapag-login kahit hindi pa verified — soft). Ang inaasahan: 200
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "verify-demo@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. /me. Ang inaasahan: 200 · "emailVerified": false
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. I-verify — palitan ang PASTE-DITO ng token mula sa terminal (#1).
###    Ang inaasahan: 204 — at ang #3 ay magiging "emailVerified": true
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "PASTE-DITO"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Pekeng token. Ang inaasahan: 400 { "error": "This verification link is invalid or has expired" }
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "gawa-gawa-lang"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. Magpadala ulit ng link. Ang inaasahan:
###    202 kung hindi pa verified (bagong email sa terminal; ang luma ay hindi na gagana)
###    Day 69: kahit 20 beses na sabay — ISANG aktibong link lang (partial UNIQUE index + upsert). Patunay: concurrency.test.ts
###    409 { "error": "Email is already verified" } kung verified na (pagkatapos ng #4)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/resend-verification
